WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.410
After How I Met Your Mother went off the air
in 2014, Alyson Hannigan seemed to drop off

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.730
the face of the Earth, or, at least, our television
screens.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.700
So what exactly happened to the star?

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:16.180
While many people were introduced to Alyson
Hannigan as American Pie's Michelle, A.K.A.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.200
"Band Camp Girl", she's pretty well known
for being a main cast member in two super

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.140
popular television shows, Buffy The Vampire
Slayer and How I Met Your Mother.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:29.540
In Buffy, she played the role of Willow Rosenberg,
a shy teenage computer geek who grows to become

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.960
a confident witch with extraordinary powers.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:36.520
In How I Met Your Mother, she played Lily
Aldrin, an artistic teacher whose relationship

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:41.240
with Marshall Eriksen provides a foil for
the perpetually looking-for-love Ted Mosby.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:42.120
"That's it!

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.960
This is Thanksgiving.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:45.540
Solve this, right now!

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.720
And if you have sex again, neither of you
gets dessert!"

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:54.380
She was in the spotlight as part of two highly
prominent television shows, so it may be hard

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:58.370
to re-sell Hannigan to moviegoers as a movie
star rather than as someone who shines best

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.360
on TV.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:04.860
Developed for CBS by Ben Affleck and Matt
Damon as a star vehicle for comedian Tom Papa,

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.200
More Time with Family got a ton of buzz in
early 2014 just as How I Met Your Mother was

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:09.880
wrapping up.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.960
The show was even shot on the old How I Met
Your Mother stage, except in front of a live

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:14.800
studio audience.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:19.009
Ultimately, the network passed on the show,
which had to be a pretty massive disappointment

00:01:19.009 --> 00:01:20.620
to Hannigan, and to her fans.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:24.880
Two years later, though, another project started
being widely promoted as Hannigan's "first

00:01:24.889 --> 00:01:29.119
major role after How I Met Your Mother:" TV
Land's adaptation of the popular '90s film

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.140
First Wives Club.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:35.240
This version cast Hannigan alongside Smash
star Megan Hilty and Vanessa Lachey, who is

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:38.840
famous for, let's be honest, marrying Jessica
Simpson's ex.

00:01:39.009 --> 00:01:43.360
Sadly, history repeated itself and TV Land
passed on the show, instead moving forward

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:44.860
with an adaptation of Heathers.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:49.680
This effectively left Hannigan with two small
one-off parts on TV shows and a single, forgettable

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.990
indie film as her only credits since 2014.

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:56.600
Why spend all that time learning lines and
going on auditions when you can make a killing

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.480
with real estate?

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:02.700
Hollywood is notoriously fickle, but property
is almost always a solid investment, as evidenced

00:02:02.709 --> 00:02:07.679
by Hannigan's growing portfolio, which made
headlines in December of 2016 after she and

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:12.180
her husband, Alexis Denisof, picked up a new
home worth nearly $8 million.

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:17.100
The couple's L.A. pad, whose distinctive architecture
was featured in the Anthony Hopkins/Ryan Gosling

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:21.360
movie Fracture, is just part of a list of
properties that includes a home in Atlanta

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.260
and a rental property in Santa Monica.

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:27.010
Nothing against any of her best-known characters,
but it sounds like Hannigan may have found

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:28.010
the role of a lifetime.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.880
Although Alyson Hannigan experienced something
of a slowdown on the acting front since her

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:37.260
nine-year run on How I Met Your Mother, she's
also had a lot more luck in the TV competition

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.560
series department.

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:43.420
In 2016, she was announced as the incoming
host for the CW's magician reality show Penn

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:48.150
&amp; Teller: Fool Us, aiding as the title magicians
welcome their budding peers to try and trick

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:50.260
them to earn a spot on their live shows.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.080
"Penn and Teller have already been fooled
once.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.220
Let's see if this next magician can do it
a second time."

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:59.960
For Hannigan, the gig was a good match for
her lifestyle; as she said in a statement:

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:03.540
"I am so excited to be hosting a program our
whole family can watch together."

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:07.550
As a bonus, she's also gotten to watch her
two daughters learn their first magic tricks

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:08.280
from the pros.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:12.940
The show, which films in Las Vegas, has featured
Hannigan as its host since its third season,

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:17.270
and it doesn't show signs of stopping anytime
soon; the network renewed the series for a

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:18.940
sixth season in 2018.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.240
The show is far from over for Alyson Hannigan.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:26.020
Although her post-How I Met Your Mother return
to TV may not have panned out the way her

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:29.150
fans had hoped, she hasn't given up on the
small screen yet.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:34.720
In 2018, she was cast in a recurring role
for WGN America's second season of Pure, a

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:38.800
Mennonite crime drama in which she'll portray
a woman helping her significant other launder

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.360
money for a drug cartel.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:44.760
The role is a far cry from her usual image,
so it should allow her to show her audience

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:45.480
a new side.

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:50.040
Hannigan also landed a leading role in the
Twitter thread-inspired comedy-horror feature

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:54.330
You Might Be the Killer, based on a viral
fictional story about a camp counselor who

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.260
may or may not have become a mass murderer.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:01.580
She was also cast as surgeon-slash-mother
Dr. Ann Possible in the Disney Channel's live-action

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:05.700
adaptation of Kim Possible, which means she'll
have another family-friendly film that she

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.080
can screen with her own children.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:10.940
While her workload might have slowed down
a bit from the old days of dominating TV,

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.000
she's still keeping herself quite busy.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:16.500
"I'm not going anywhere."

